{"ticker":"SKYD","updated":"2026-10-30T23:11:35Z","profile":{"longName":"Skydance Corporation","shortName":"Skydance Corporation","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","country":"United States","website":"https://www.skydance.com","fullTimeEmployees":17600,"marketCap":40085315584,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":145.04652,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.3770291,"pegRatio":2.54,"targetMeanPrice":9.14667,"targetHighPrice":13.74,"targetLowPrice":4.2,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.009,"earningsGrowth":-0.541,"grossMargins":0.33328998,"operatingMargins":0.09345,"profitMargins":-0.021329999,"totalRevenue":29109999616,"beta":1.547,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":17.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":6.61,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.53},"summary":"Skydance Corporation operates as a media and entertainment company worldwide. It operates in three segments: Studios, Direct-to-Consumer, and TV Media. The company operates CBS Television Network, a domestic broadcast television network; CBS Stations, a television station; international free-to-air networks comprising Network 10, Channel 5, Telefe, and Chilevisión; and domestic premium and basic cable networks, such as Nickelodeon, MTV, CMT, Comedy Central, BET, Paramount+ with SHOWTIME, Paramount Network, The Smithsonian Channel, BET Media Group, CBS Sports Network, and international extensions of these brands. It also provides domestic and international television studio operations, including CBS Studios, Paramount Television Studios, and Showtime; CBS Media Ventures, which produces and distributes first-run syndicated programming; and digital properties consist of CBS News and CBS Sports HQ. In addition, the company offers a portfolio of domestic and international pay and free streaming services, including Paramount+, Pluto TV, and BET+. Further, it produces and acquires films, series, and short-form content for release and licensing worldwide, including in theaters, on streaming services, on television, through home entertainment, and DVDs, Blu-ray; and operates a portfolio consisting of Paramount Pictures, Paramount Players, Paramount Animation, Nickelodeon Studio, and Mir","summary_zh":"Skydance Corporation 是一家全球媒體和娛樂公司。它分為三個部門：工作室、直接面對消費者、電視媒體。該公司經營國內廣播電視網 CBS 電視網； CBS Stations，一家電視台；國際免費網路，包括 Network 10、Channel 5、Telefe 和 Chilevisión；以及國內優質和基本有線電視網路，例如 Nickelodeon、MTV、CMT、Comedy Central、BET、Paramount+ with SHOWTIME、派拉蒙網路、BMT、Comedy Central、BET、Paramount+ with SHOWTIME、派拉蒙網路、國際它還提供國內和國際電視工作室運營，包括 CBS Studios、Paramount Television Studios 和 Showtime； CBS Media Ventures，製作和發行首播聯合節目；數位資產包括哥倫比亞廣播公司新聞和哥倫比亞廣播公司體育總部。此外，該公司還提供一系列國內和國際付費和免費串流媒體服務，包括 Paramount+、Pluto TV 和 BET+。此外，它還製作和收購電影、連續劇和短片內容，以便在全球範圍內發行和授權，包括在影院、串流媒體服務、電視、家庭娛樂以及 DVD、藍光；並經營由派拉蒙影業、派拉蒙影業公司、派拉蒙動畫公司、尼克兒童頻道和 Mir 組成的投資組合","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"娛樂","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":14.54,"h":14.66,"l":14.19,"c":14.46,"v":5127200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":14.45,"h":15.31,"l":14.39,"c":15.06,"v":8362700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":14.92,"h":15.04,"l":14.41,"c":14.74,"v":5291800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":14.48,"h":15.18,"l":14.48,"c":15.0,"v":7422200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":15.07,"h":15.24,"l":14.75,"c":15.19,"v":6514800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":14.95,"h":15.47,"l":14.72,"c":15.2,"v":6071100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":15.3,"h":15.79,"l":14.83,"c":15.11,"v":6164300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":15.02,"h":17.58,"l":13.99,"c":17.46,"v":48508800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":17.46,"h":18.87,"l":16.9,"c":18.79,"v":32421300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":18.8,"h":19.05,"l":18.22,"c":18.58,"v":11157400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":18.59,"h":18.62,"l":17.45,"c":17.53,"v":9622700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":17.64,"h":18.31,"l":17.57,"c":17.92,"v":7332400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":18.0,"h":18.15,"l":17.66,"c":17.88,"v":5567000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":18.0,"h":19.23,"l":17.7,"c":18.92,"v":21734800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":18.92,"h":19.3,"l":18.48,"c":18.61,"v":13813100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":18.69,"h":20.86,"