「要約」）。"}],"markets":[{"en":"TV Media. Our (1) domestic and international broadcast networks and owned television stations; (2) domestic cable networks and international extensions of certain of our domestic cable network brands; and (3) domestic and international television studio operations, and the production and distribution of first-run syndicated programming.","zh":"電視媒體。我們的（1）國內和國際廣播網路和擁有的電視台； (2) 國內有線電視網路以及我們某些國內有線電視網路品牌的國際延伸； （三）國內外電視演播室運營以及首播聯合節目的製作和發行。"},{"en":"Filmed Entertainment. Our production and acquisition of films, series and short-form content for release and licensing around the world, including in theaters, on streaming services, on television, and through digital and physical home entertainment.","zh":"拍攝娛樂節目。我們製作和收購電影、連續劇和短片內容，以便在世界各地發行和授權，包括在影院、串流媒體服務、電視以及透過數位和實體家庭娛樂。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in highly competitive industries and markets and compete for creative talent and intellectual property, as well as for audiences, advertisers and distribution of our content.","zh":"我們在競爭激烈的行業和市場中運營，爭奪創意人才和智慧財產權，以及受眾、廣告商和內容分發。"},{"en":"We compete with a wide range of media, technology and entertainment companies with substantial resources to produce, acquire and distribute content globally, including broadcast and cable networks, streaming services, film and television studios, production companies, independent producers and syndicators, television stations and television station groups. We compete with other content creators for creative talent, including producers, directors, actors and writers, as well as for rights to new content ideas and intellectual property and the acquisition of popular programming.","zh":"我們與眾多擁有大量資源在全球範圍內製作、獲取和分發內容的媒體、技術和娛樂公司競爭，包括廣播和有線電視、串流媒體服務、電影和電視工作室、製作公司、獨立製片人和聯合組織、電視台和電視台集團。我們與其他內容創作者競爭創意人才，包括製片人、導演、演員和作家，​​以及新內容創意和智慧財產權的權利以及流行節目的收購。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2024-12-31","items":[{"name":"TV Media","val":18779000000,"zh":"電視媒體部門"},{"name":"Direct To Consumer","val":7632000000,"zh":"直接面向消費者區隔市場"},{"name":"Filmed Entertainment","val":2955000000,"zh":"影視娛樂部門"}],"total":29213000000},"prod":{"end":"2024-12-31","items":[{"name":"Affiliate & Subscription","val":13153000000,"zh":"附屬機構和訂閱"},{"name":"Advertising","val":10295000000,"zh":"廣告"},{"name":"Licensing & Other","val":4952000000,"zh":"許可及其他"},{"name":"Theatrical","val":813000000,"zh":"戲劇"}],"total":29213000000},"geo":{"end":"2024-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":23688000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":5525000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":29213000000}},"peers":["KLAR","BLSH","KVUE","STUB","BULL"]}}